(7784862, 1295596, 30049, '<td valign="top">
Sometimes a title works well and helps the presentation.  This is one of those cases.  The image has a fairly sturdy point of interest.  Seems like the timing / exposure may have been a bit harsh by the actions potentially taken in post to compensate?  The texture is given away in a couple of ways; the foggy piece in the lower left, and the strong sense of grain especially in the dark sky area.  For me it makes it feel a little muddy.  Some may like it.  Just a personal opinion.  One last nit, sorry ... but why such a wide comp / crop on this?  Did you look at it with the left side pulled in a bit?  Anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Sometimes a title works well and helps the presentation.  This is one of those cases.  The image has a fairly sturdy point of interest.  Seems like the timing / exposure may have been a bit harsh by the actions potentially taken in post to compensate?  The texture is given away in a couple of ways; the foggy piece in the lower left, and the strong sense of grain especially in the dark sky area.  For me it makes it feel a little muddy.  Some may like it.  Just a personal opinion.  One last nit, sorry ... but why such a wide comp / crop on this?  Did you look at it with the left side pulled in a bit?  Anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2025-07-18 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
